{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 This is a ReaScript for REAPER that provides tools for cleaning up MIDI CC data. It removes redundant control change events and smooths selected CCs in the MIDI editor.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The tool provides a user interface for adjusting settings and applying CC cleanup operations to selected MIDI CCs in the MIDI editor.\par}
}
]]></description>
